<title>JAPAN: Inabata &amp; Co - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Inabata &amp; Co - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		125.95		vs	  124.51</p>
<p> Operating	  970 million	 vs	  814 million</p>
<p> Current		1.25		vs	  681 million</p>
<p> Net		  558 million	 vs	  317 million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.90 yen	  vs	    5.64 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     56 million	  vs	  56 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Inabata &amp; Co Ltd is a trading house specialising in chemicals and plastics and is affiliated with Sumitomo Chemical Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
